      "message": "I think:\n[Root Cause]: The internal state of the EQ biquad filter was not properly reconstructed when the channel count changed. As a result, the filter retained incorrect states while processing data for the new channel configuration, leading to persistent noise artifacts.\n\n[Solution]: Clear and rebuild the biquad filter instances according to the updated channel count whenever the channel configuration changes.",
